x}-8 & 0 & -4 \\\\ 0 & -4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.$" :question/worked-solution "The matrix $A$ is an upper triangular matrix since all the entries below the main diagonal are zeros.\n\nThe matrices $B$ and $C$ are *not* upper triangular matrices since they each have a non-zero element below the main diagonal: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{b}_{31} & =-1\\ne 0 \\\\ {c}_{32} & =2\\ne 0\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186479928 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1a9d1d21-7b21-52d6-a6eb-d39e84838138" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186479913} {:answer/id #uuid "e8353198-6db6-5ce0-8192-5d16d6fbc638" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186479935}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186479913} :answer-field/id #uuid "2548dc7d-fd02-52f0-8019-6f18794e6db3" :answer-field/key "C" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186479918} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0c393f8f-1ca4-5943-95ec-73eebd93127b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186479910} {:answer/id #uuid "3d5af780-d676-510e-9920-035872a25aa3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186479923}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186479923} :answer-field/id #uuid "3c34f961-ec69-5bc1-aa19-9fba2628899c" :answer-field/key "B" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186479922} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "92ff392c-3617-5857-bb0b-90ec60551f8f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186479927} {:answer/id #uuid "b764fd77-640c-5a94-adfb-926828fa54e3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186479930}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186479930} :answer-field/id #uuid "d74978fd-cbb2-591b-886c-5a3c10ea943f" :answer-field/key "A" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186479933}] :question/id #uuid "95bb49c4-214d-5ba6-82cc-f31f7a47c4fb" :question/problem "Which of the following matrices are upper triangular matrices?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n$A=\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 0 & 9 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 10 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}-8 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 7 & -3 \\\\ 10 & -7 & 2\\end{bmatrix},\\,C=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 7 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.$" :question/worked-solution "The matrix $A$ is an upper triangular matrix since all the entries below the main diagonal are zeros.\n\nThe matrices $B$ and $C$ are *not* upper triangular matrices since they each have a non-zero element below the main diagonal: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{b}_{31} & =10\\ne 0 \\\\ {c}_{32} & =7\\ne 0\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Identifying a Triangular Matrix"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119784 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119598 :question/id #uuid "205d32a2-ac26-5eaf-896a-c6182a70eff7" :question/math-academy-id "e-4498" :question/problem "Consider the matrix \n![](images/4d/4dd9b1c1b3d789c166ecd8f6d2a909609c7f4324705c84115cce84a29181bf32.png)\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\n- $A$ is upper triangular\n\n- $A$ is lower triangular\n\n- $A^T-A$ is lower triangular" :question/worked-solution "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is false, since $A$ has non-zero entries below the main diagonal:\n![](images/c1/c1ec838cd30cca8fbb2e3996d5a7d84dadb233e1951d05b532a9d606d887eb2f.png)\n\n- Statement II is true, since all the entries above the main diagonal are zeros:\n![](images/f3/f39c68a9b1f5e16caffbf159b629a958e147e14099334b049bdfcd857eef84d2.png)\n\n- Statement III is false, since the result of $A^T-A$ has non-zero entries above the main diagonal:\n![](images/f4/f4415c87201f5b92f23e3320c313cd58ac4e720135928645896f976614c5eaa0.png)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only\"."} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "e69a4aee-6e92-598b-99b5-1d830b6dea54" :knowledge-point/question-generator {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186488405 :question-generator/id #uuid "2ead4764-174c-5d84-bcf9-29e935ade0e4" :question-generator/script "generate/scratch/17592186119784.py"} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186120422 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "767ebc71-0ad3-54b6-aa71-7c8c0b0f3bfc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438302} {:answer/id #uuid "a63f8938-30f5-513c-a258-cd4d1a6a7304" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438303}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438302} :answer-field/id #uuid "57ffd47f-b693-5f52-b1f1-700e84eec01a" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439180} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2809995c-d5a8-548e-8bde-0875034527de" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438304} {:answer/id #uuid "eaacdaf9-bb58-5783-b3f8-b3ace0a6d805" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438305}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438305} :answer-field/id #uuid "51bb348a-eb47-53be-9c6a-af21f5e21289" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439181} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9ee6e55d-811b-5fea-8eb0-bfe2370d455c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438306} {:answer/id #uuid "26cce80e-998b-5997-9b94-fa52ef460fa0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438307}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438307} :answer-field/id #uuid "f8e98b2f-07d9-5dce-aec0-dbf12be54818" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439182}] :question/id #uuid "39d12d09-6555-5993-ad4c-5e191be1b0c7" :question/math-academy-id "q-42091" :question/problem "Consider the matrix \n$A=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 3\\end{bmatrix}.$\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $A$ is upper triangular\n- **II.** $A$ is lower triangular\n- **III.** ${A}^{T}$ is upper triangular" :question/worked-solution "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is false, since $A$ has non-zero entries below the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- Statement II is true. All the entries above the main diagonal of $A$ are zeros:\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- Statement III is true. All the entries below the main diagonal of ${A}^{T}$ are zeros:\n\n$$\n{A}^{T}=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186120426 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "76bc55da-83d7-5857-aa45-f67452354c98" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439761} {:answer/id #uuid "04de8af5-832b-52ca-a350-f0f854ef704b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439762}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.typ