 and a21=-1 are nonzero. However A^T+A=diag(-6,2,10), so statement II is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186262616 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "12919bee-30a9-5706-b50b-8d68bb9ec18f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437740} {:answer/id #uuid "bf178365-d264-5e92-b9fa-13b65028e647" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437741}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437741} :answer-field/id #uuid "4fea4c98-9183-5469-a75e-5f3f42402c15" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438899} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9c11d7ef-9785-5af7-9c0c-e9bd1c6a90b6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437742} {:answer/id #uuid "9223ddb4-98d2-5931-a218-a09a74ddf7ab" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437743}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437742} :answer-field/id #uuid "d0b3decd-5ac4-5039-a12b-8665619852b6" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438900} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a52ffa70-0c3f-53a1-ac44-7af5faba118b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437744} {:answer/id #uuid "cc394039-cc55-5bf1-8409-56c46c0c7d51" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437745}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437744} :answer-field/id #uuid "ecc05fd9-552e-52c7-aa2c-c25a1903c6fd" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438901}] :question/id #uuid "d3df39a1-3dce-5051-9bb1-2a36ee3c62ca" :question/math-academy-id "q-126477" :question/problem "Consider the matrix \n$B=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}.$\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $B$ is upper triangular\n- **II.** $B$ is lower triangular\n- **III.** $B-{B}^{T}$ is upper triangular" :question/worked-solution "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is true, since all the entries below the main diagonal equal to zero:\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- Statement II is false, since $A$ has non-zero entries above the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- Statement III is false, since the result of $B-{B}^{T}$ has non-zero entries below the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nB-{B}^{T}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 5 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -5 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186262617 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "eb56e3e4-d13e-506f-b457-467943ab9482" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437746} {:answer/id #uuid "86262feb-536d-5ef8-afcc-c7b14bc45026" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437747}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437747} :answer-field/id #uuid "1080d492-9821-5364-8530-4c7dbd0bd3c0" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438902} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0a0f61d8-2bc9-5ba5-8d56-d3b975c8bf07" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.t