in diagonal of ${C}^{T}$ are zeros:\n\n$$\n{C}^{T}=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I, II, and III\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186262618 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0fbb2fac-47b6-5bca-8490-fe78f86c36be" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437752} {:answer/id #uuid "a79d2921-bc2e-5736-ba05-a01f24841be1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437753}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437752} :answer-field/id #uuid "5f459b66-0738-5236-8dd3-52a31064b6f5" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438905} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "604f880c-2e1e-517e-a3c7-ef164e3b3d96" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437754} {:answer/id #uuid "a443e628-f92b-5017-95b2-5e8bba5b46fa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437755}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437755} :answer-field/id #uuid "9e5203b2-20a0-5e9e-a92d-30a5804f233d" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438906} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8fb1ade4-2d9c-553f-b227-e71d2d355d0b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437756} {:answer/id #uuid "a1accfd8-f860-523b-b6c2-17f3e9aa8cf7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437757}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437756} :answer-field/id #uuid "0a592820-3f24-5c9e-bdb8-cd57