 zero: \n\n$$\n{A}^{T}+A=\\begin{bmatrix}16 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 6\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I, II, and III\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186326929 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "99c6bb28-f335-5bbd-98ef-7c10debcd116" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438308} {:answer/id #uuid "f443bd43-943d-5991-a1db-7e129b593206" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438309}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438309} :answer-field/id #uuid "cbe78ff6-d1f1-58f5-8add-6b463affc7cc" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439183} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e07dc0e6-51e2-5ce8-a1b4-44727450bef9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438310} {:answer/id #uuid "cef77811-df7c-59ed-a36f-ed5228a3ebc8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438311}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438310} :answer-field/id #uuid "371815f8-f16e-5680-9ce5-31f3cff1d9be" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439184} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "76c420bb-1528-5dc2-9b89-925a5134c93a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438312} {:answer/id #uuid "f06b9547-425a-5254-b4f6-2c95fe1f7d28" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438313}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438312} :answer-field/id #uuid "9ba6e7f7-ddb2-5a5c-9829-6eb52ab534d3" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439185}] :question/id #uuid "7fc84187-05b2-57ce-8e48-261250d11c80" :question/math-academy-id "q-42116" :question/problem "Consider the matrix \n$A=\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.$\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $A$ is lower triangular\n- **II.** ${A}^{T}-A$ is lower triangular\n- **III.** $A$ is upper triangular" :question/worked-solution "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is true, since all the entries above the main diagonal are zeros:\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- Statement II is false, since the result of ${A}^{T}-A$ has non-zero entries above the main diagonal:\n\n$$\n{A}^{T}-A=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- Statement III is false, since $A$ has non-zero entries below the main diagonal\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186335970 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a9d2a661-7d90-525c-9631-0c05ef108b03" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438454} {:answer/id #uuid "5deab4fd-cb30-5b98-a484-4483eb06b0c4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438455}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438454} :answer-field/id #uuid "89c02379-086d-5617-b96e-c2e3ec7d9a9b" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439256} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "69513619-f7d9-5728-9237-83bd49e641c5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186