ive formulation\n\n$$\n[T]_{B}={P}_{B\\to C}^{-1}\\cdot [T]_{C}\\cdot {P}_{B\\to C}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186272064 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "525de6aa-bc06-5fb2-8b57-d030bfea5609" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449556} {:answer/id #uuid "76383dc8-b07d-5da6-a0f8-3e3e160edd4a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449557}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449557} :answer-field/id #uuid "668f1b09-54dc-5332-92bf-fa0c0746ea48" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450732} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "02c13acd-e218-582d-8b3f-0052625f748d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449558} {:answer/id #uuid "1b3e8dff-05eb-5f8a-b119-18f4d1b087fe" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449559}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449558} :answer-field/id #uuid "9df531d2-e4ae-5fef-b0fc-dee7598d3b7e" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450733} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "29f5b7b3-e092-5649-ab6e-26506be9ca10" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449560} {:answer/id #uuid "1fee3d4c-1a3f-5145-990c-3f79a5c72792" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449561}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449560} :answer-field/id #uuid "e28759ca-7435-54da-9df5-57bdee87df1b" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-fie